00:02:31.558 --> 00:02:33.898
Is it true there's ice and a sauna?

00:02:33.898 --> 00:02:34.836
That's my setup.

00:02:34.836 --> 00:02:36.118
What do you guys do?

00:02:36.118 --> 00:02:38.128
- Well, it's not really a vacation.

00:02:38.128 --> 00:02:38.961
I have a cabin.

00:02:38.961 --> 00:02:40.738
I spend half my time out in the woods,

00:02:40.738 --> 00:02:41.698
deep in the woods of Minnesota.

00:02:41.698 --> 00:02:43.288
- [Drew] Another reason I love you.

00:02:43.288 --> 00:02:44.668
- Truly, it's my happy place.

00:02:44.668 --> 00:02:47.848
And one of the things we do in the winter

00:02:47.848 --> 00:02:51.598
is snowmobile, and ice
fish and ice plunge.

00:02:51.598 --> 00:02:53.638
So what's happened over
the last couple of years

00:02:53.638 --> 00:02:56.398
is people around the lake know about it.

00:02:56.398 --> 00:02:58.438
It's become this tradition
to bring in the new year.

00:02:58.438 --> 00:03:00.478
People jump in that ice hole.

00:03:00.478 --> 00:03:04.138
And I have a wood burning
sauna right next to it.

00:03:04.138 --> 00:03:05.280
So you get in there first,

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.588
then you get in the ice, then
you get back in the sauna.

00:03:07.588 --> 00:03:09.898
- It just sounds like so much fun.

00:03:09.898 --> 00:03:10.828
- It really is.

00:03:10.828 --> 00:03:15.688
- Okay, speaking of a
beautiful way to put things,

00:03:15.688 --> 00:03:20.011
will you tell me about
the proposal that you did?

00:03:21.838 --> 00:03:23.411
Again, where does it end with you?

00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:24.658
- I mean, I wish I could say

00:03:24.658 --> 00:03:26.068
that I'm usually this romantic,

00:03:26.068 --> 00:03:28.438
but this was one of my best.

00:03:28.438 --> 00:03:29.271
- Okay.

00:03:29.271 --> 00:03:30.808
- Yeah, I'm really proud of this one.

00:03:30.808 --> 00:03:32.305
So one morning, I was sitting there

00:03:32.305 --> 00:03:33.695
and I was like, "Okay,
tonight's the tonight.

00:03:33.695 --> 00:03:34.685
"I think I gotta do it tonight.

00:03:34.685 --> 00:03:35.758
"I gotta do it tonight."

00:03:35.758 --> 00:03:37.588
And I thought, "Okay, we're gonna do."

00:03:37.588 --> 00:03:39.538
There's a beautiful little sandbar

00:03:39.538 --> 00:03:41.638
at Little Palm Island is where we stayed.

00:03:41.638 --> 00:03:43.498
And I had this idea to do this like,

00:03:43.498 --> 00:03:47.368
what if I put like a message
in a bottle that rolled up?

00:03:47.368 --> 00:03:48.598
And I went up to the concierge,

00:03:48.598 --> 00:03:50.578
asked if they had an old wine bottle.

00:03:50.578 --> 00:03:53.218
They did, took some
stationery from the hotel,

00:03:53.218 --> 00:03:54.508
burned the edges.

00:03:54.508 --> 00:03:56.398
I had it all timed out with the concierge

00:03:56.398 --> 00:04:00.808
so that we're gonna be
out at 5:15 for dinner.

00:04:00.808 --> 00:04:02.488
I need you to go put it at 5:14,

00:04:02.488 --> 00:04:03.838
have the bottle in there
so when we can walk out,

00:04:03.838 --> 00:04:05.698
it's just rolling up to the thing.

00:04:05.698 --> 00:04:07.378
And that's when she found the bottle,

00:04:07.378 --> 00:04:09.416
and that's when I asked her to marry me.

00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:10.258
(audience applauding)

00:04:10.258 --> 00:04:11.091
And it worked!

00:04:12.898 --> 00:04:16.411
- All right, so let's add this layer in.

00:04:17.848 --> 00:04:20.424
You make a mean lasagna apparently.

00:04:20.424 --> 00:04:23.728
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:04:23.728 --> 00:04:25.438
- I make two things.

00:04:25.438 --> 00:04:27.748
