I make really good lasagna.

00:04:27.748 --> 00:04:31.438
And lasagna was literally out
of necessity from college.

00:04:31.438 --> 00:04:33.508
- I was gonna say you
learned to do it in college.

00:04:33.508 --> 00:04:35.818
- It's not a fancy recipe at all,

00:04:35.818 --> 00:04:37.361
but it's so good.
- But will you teach it to us?

00:04:37.361 --> 00:04:38.481
